WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
A patient in the hospital is on an IV.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.760
The bag holds 500 milliliters
of salt solution.

3
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:12.160
The label gives its strength as
9.00 grams of salt per liter.

4
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.680
Two different volumes,
and a mass, not an amount.

5
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.860
So how many moles of salt are in the bag?

6
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.360
In this mission, you'll learn what
a concentration really measures,

7
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.380
and how to prepare a standard solution.

8
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:30.360
You'll convert milliliters to liters,
and grams per liter to moles per liter.

9
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.510
Your mission: work out how many
moles of salt are in the bag.